    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="privacy_subtitle">Music never sends your data anywhere</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Music works completely offline. The app does not have internet permission, so it cannot send anything off your device.\n\nIt reads the music files and tags already on your phone to show your library. Your playlists, favorites, play counts and settings are saved only in the app’s private storage on this device.\n\nThere are no accounts, no analytics, no advertising and no crash reporting. Music never deletes your music files.\n\nUninstalling the app removes its data.</string>
    <string name="notices_title">Usage notice and licences</string>
    <string name="notices_text">Music is free for personal use and has no purchases or subscriptions. It is provided as is, without warranty.\n\nBuilt with open-source software: AndroidX Jetpack Compose and Media3 (Apache License 2.0), Kotlin and Kotlinx Coroutines (Apache License 2.0), Google Guava (Apache License 2.0). The Montserrat font is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
